        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset BRNL-SQT, Breton Square Rose Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Breton Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, privacy and keyed entry functions. This modern leverset was designed with the end user in mind. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. The Breton Lever has reversible handing. The latch can also adjust to accommodate 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Breton Square Rose Leverset will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Breton Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA Grade 3</li>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>SmartKey Anti-pick system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed lever.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Meets UL 3 hour fire rating for 409, 412, 413, 420, 430 Optional UL 1/3 hour fire rating for all functions.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Breton Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore 2 1/8\". Edge Bore 1\".</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 1/2\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1\" x 2 1/4\" full lip.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Visible installation screws on this function. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
