                "title": "Breton Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Breton Lever with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, privacy and keyed entry functions. This modern leverset was designed with the end user in mind. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. The Breton Lever has reversible handing. The latch can also adjust to accommodate 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Breton Square Rose Leverset will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick. ",
